      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"letting go of the need to find a grand point\"... that sounds almost peaceful, in a dark way. like if i just stopped fighting it, the weight would finally disappear. i'm just so tired of the noise and the constant battle against things that can't be won. is there really any other way to actually find that kind of peace? or is it all just more struggle until the end?",
